{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<p>想把社群短片與相片貼文留下來慢慢重看的用戶，可以留意 PocketTok。用戶只需貼上支援的公開連結，或經分享選單把內容傳送到 PocketTok，即可將貼文收藏到裝置上的媒體庫，並以合集整理。原價 US $99.99 的終生版現正限時免費，內購限時免費中，適合經常收藏食譜、靈感與旅遊影片的人。</p>\n<img alt=\"限時免費\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/460x460bb-75-186.webp\">\n<h2>收藏短片隨時重看</h2>\n<p>PocketTok 把支援的公開影片與相片貼文收藏到個人媒體庫，用戶貼上連結或經分享選單傳送即可保存。媒體庫可依創作者或說明文字搜尋，並支援篩選與排序，亦可為食譜、靈感、旅遊等主題建立合集。來源提供字幕時會顯示原字幕，收藏內容可分享，或複製貼文連結與說明文字。</p>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1284x2778bb-221-scaled.jpg\">\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1284x2778bb-222-scaled.jpg\">\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1284x2778bb-223-scaled.jpg\">\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1284x2778bb-224-scaled.jpg\">\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1284x2778bb-225-scaled.jpg\">\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1284x2778bb-226-scaled.jpg\">\n<h2>限時免費領取終生版</h2>\n<p>PocketTok – Save Videos 終生版內購限時免費中，用戶完成初始化後看到收費牆，Lifetime 價格顯示為$0 即可免費收下。注意，如果看到價格不是 $0 代表限免已完結，請勿按付費確認。</p>\n<ul>\n<li>應用名稱：PocketTok – Save Videos</li>\n<li>應用類別：Photo &amp; Video</li>\n<li>下載位置：App Store</li>\n</ul>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-17T14:59:12.504221+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":466,"images":7,"source":"New MobileLife","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-17T14:43:32+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-18T00:17:34.221677+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-17T14:57:36.681371+00:00","content_hash":"42ed1e77b60656550691439d19d955a93a11169ac2b423d7f64fc59cae305b3e","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}